      "purpose": "Provides pure utility helpers for normalized entity state management with Immer drafts, used by entity adapters to extract ids, coerce inputs, unwrap drafts, and partition added vs updated entities.",
      "summary": "This file exports a small set of utility functions that operate on normalized entity state in an Immer draft context. It safely extracts an entity identifier via a caller-provided selector with a development-only warning when undefined, coerces either an array or record of entities into an array, unwraps Immer drafts to their current value, and partitions incoming entities into newly added versus updated based on existing state identifiers. These helpers are used internally by entity reducer logic to maintain consistency of ids and entities maps.",
